<p><strong><%= @context.name %></strong> (context <%= @context.id %>) has servers whose live check reported connected: false:</p>
<ul>
  <% @servers.each do |server| %>
    <li>
      <%= server[:name] %> (<%= server[:instance] %>)
      <% if server[:paused] %>— paused<% end %>
      <% if server[:error].present? %>: <%= server[:error] %><% end %>
    </li>
  <% end %>
</ul>
<p>Open that context in EmCP and sign those servers in again.</p>
